  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Tech sphere (Remote Control).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your remote control can be used to override signals that don’t belong to you. Locating foreign signals with the remote control requires a Craft (mechanical) check opposed by their sphere DC. Each time you spend an action to control their gadgets you musts make a craft Craft (mechanical) check opposed by their sphere DC +5.</p>\n<p>In place of an activation check or Craft (mechanical) check, each time you spend an action to control a foreign gadget, it gets to attempt a Will saving throw opposed by your Tech sphere DC.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc118\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
